:local-id=\"0fb737eb-58c0-45e3-a3bf-03c5ce7f039e\"><p local-id=\"b1fae1ae3a27\">Primary payment processor at checkout. Renders Drop-In component (card, Apple Pay, Google Pay, PayPal). Handles 3DS2 SCA for EU/UK.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"6fd5fd5f-8e6f-47dd-8b45-1b1c00c58a7f\"><p local-id=\"f4c06d8690e8\">Adyen Web Drop-In SDK (client-side) + Adyen Checkout API (server-side via SCAPI custom endpoint)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d8369855-b19a-44a8-9bae-acdf4d015ad7\"><p local-id=\"8142e4b2441c\">Real-time on payment step load and on Place Order submit</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b728e422-e9e6-46d4-8968-b419c61f01cf\"><p local-id=\"b12c11210323\">Payment method details (tokenised card / wallet)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"ae5db5bb-debb-47d2-a147-a6708991d503\"><p local-id=\"a9ea83a0a72f\">Authorisation token, payment result (AUTHORISED / REFUSED)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b5e9808a-a693-46e0-8fbe-55d23cee77d4\"><p local-id=\"8d1a44a418cb\"> </p></td><td ac:local-id=\"dc95cf52-25f9-4333-bbc3-1daebdd82284\"><p local-id=\"fdb8a95a231c\">Adyen integration powered by Salesforce Payments. </p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a6eccfb6-17b2-4b75-a1ad-282e04859b70\"><p local-id=\"d7460c7a74c1\">AU, US, UK, EU, HK</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"49d2e892-7e77-440e-832c-8f83cd28f14d\"><p local-id=\"85cd214a01c6\">Confirmed</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4296320b-fd4b-4f8f-96a3-e1ac9cc2a592\"><p local-id=\"6399dd7e1bac\">P0</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"41125f82-c6a5-4a54-bafd-4f49ca5486d0\"><td ac:local-id=\"c43622b4-5458-4184-a2ff-ada12d8011f4\" colspan=\"12\"><p local-id=\"2523ba29d93f\">    ▸  Payments — International</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"85a54d23-687a-48a2-9355-dceaa779eff7\"><td ac:local-id=\"eab43e93-a40d-447d-a73b-75e16e8603a9\"><p local-id=\"c0ab96ac646c\">INT-007</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"581dd88a-5766-48ae-8cdf-9f8ccc0dbae1\"><p local-id=\"974bd755f8a6\">Global-e</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b2ebc590-57b7-442d-b242-d567aba33138\"><p local-id=\"246dc287449f\">Full international checkout redirect — localised payments, duties, taxes, HS codes, and shipping for non-domestic shoppers.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"8e398828-e897-4248-b951-044983fa0089\"><p local-id=\"613ab30cc002\">Global-e Checkout API — server-side redirect; order webhook on completion</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7ed5575d-d753-4f00-9977-85fd17616a51\"><p local-id=\"7714fd562a46\">On international shopper initiating checkout</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"f262a8be-d239-4e12-86d0-0f660bd38afb\"><p local-id=\"3c9268037338\">Basket contents, customer locale, currency</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"32c4e60e-f641-49d7-a7c2-f5fc7764ad34\"><p local-id=\"fe257706057a\">Completed order object via webhook; order synced to SFCC</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"938af0d8-8efc-419d-a2a8-504dfbf07787\"><p local-id=\"a079ae27379b\"> </p></td><td ac:local-id=\"85b98a90-1435-4c79-9a73-5620d13e2913\"><p local-id=\"34569193297e\">Confirm order sync mechanism: Global-e webhook → SFCC direct. Newstore  reconciles order IDs between Global-e and SFCC</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"b23d43d6-208a-4abd-8c72-fc3347e140aa\"><p local-id=\"6ee36e94653e\">International (non-domestic)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"a9549f37-2f48-41a6-b1fc-862185353592\"><p local-id=\"528d899e6e8b\">Confirmed</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"56634ca8-bdf3-4b55-82f3-278702af1386\"><p local-id=\"40d8522803ed\">P0</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"01f34c3f-bb51-4b72-8844-42f549532cbd\"><td ac:local-id=\"4a8e509a-8164-40d4-96aa-9d8f9ff869e4\"><p local-id=\"9feadc94cf4b\">INT-012</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"9e87787c-76e2-4af5-ae33-65f74a094a6a\"><p local-id=\"cd6bb1f2a5e2\">Give-X</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"31826ab1-ff89-45c3-87d3-b4722c311d53\"><p local-id=\"25e188437dc6\">Gift card and credit note redemption field at checkout. Balance check + partial redemption supported.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"35d5db06-354e-4d45-a1fd-eb130591c653\"><p local-id=\"fb4e7e313d1e\">Give-X API via Newstore Adapator</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4214cf85-129e-40aa-857a-37eef6c08f98\"><p local-id=\"9a46466f809d\">On shopper entering gift card code</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"df4d177e-bd81-4745-afd1-73d205dfcfe3\"><p local-id=\"ed0850cd7bed\">Gift card number + PIN</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"7acb9211-5eec-4e54-b2b5-07a6bdbd7af6\"><p local-id=\"a442893d1645\">Available balance, redemption confirmation</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"da7ad03c-8dfc-49d1-9224-4b77490fa51f\"><p local-id=\"d0bb5a303089\"> </p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4ed373b4-7454-4fac-989c-90b8b252eb9f\"><p local-id=\"106a6aa3c2d8\">Documentation on how to use Newstore Apdator for integrating the Give-X redemption and check balance calls</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"26118bbd-3f6b-4c35-851f-80df6dbe2efc\"><p local-id=\"fc57c185e2af\">AU (SIT). Rollout via NewStore</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"d10b89c1-d3af-47e9-b5c2-fc6e2bbf4aac\"><p local-id=\"626f626123fd\">Under Review</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"befc3db2-903e-4cbe-9753-b814a3895a1c\"><p local-id=\"1cbffa794878\">P1</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"bed484ca-25b5-4f96-ab9c-fd92dd85700b\"><td ac:local-id=\"35133f89-f26a-44af-9ea2-5d0af3b7767e\" colspan=\"12\"><p local-id=\"3645bdb0a641\">    ▸  Tax &amp; Address</p></td></tr><tr ac:local-id=\"2049fe86-b59b-4470-8e38-0b9ff38c7f3d\"><td ac:local-id=\"2af7406c-fca5-46f6-ad54-9b48042c58ab\"><p local-id=\"eae5483a493e\">INT-008</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"5addd050-2a6b-4a33-9b0d-2d69f8fa1f07\"><p local-id=\"1696a2f294d4\">Avalara</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"afcbeb78-ba2b-4de6-8dd7-49b1f16f6994\"><p local-id=\"4a21fdcdd249\">Real-time tax calculation at cart and checkout. Commits tax transaction on order placement.</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"1eb61b8b-7af1-4d93-b351-0a044aee88d0\"><p local-id=\"dafc1287939a\">Avalara REST API — direct SFCC → Avalara call (or via MuleSoft TBD)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"c978d455-3d66-4d25-bec5-4f55853927de\"><p local-id=\"99f0c08ce4b6\">On shipping address entry (estimate) + on order submission (commit)</p></td><td ac:local-id=\"4dc65751-300d-494e-8663-61092a735e98\"><p local-id=\"575fe41b0f1b\">Cart line items,