    },
    "version": 1,
    "attachments": [],
    "content": {
      "value": "Overview\n--------\n\n| Item | Detail |\n| --- | --- |\n| JIRA | ZMOBLD-218 |\n| API Names | `magento-exp-api` · `product-availibility-prc-api` · `newstore-sys-api` |\n| Bitbucket | tryzenssalesforce / zimmermann-uk-rollout |\n| RAML | [Product Availability Process API](https://anypoint.mulesoft.com/exchange/f68f5e15-5316-4b71-8e0a-32271b931edb/product-availibility-process-api/minor/1.0/) · [NewStore System API](https://anypoint.mulesoft.com/exchange/f68f5e15-5316-4b71-8e0a-32271b931edb/newstore-system-api/minor/1.0/) |\n| Technical Owner | Surya Veer |\n\n---\n\nHigh Level Summary\n------------------\n\nUsed on the **PDP** and **Store Details** pages in SFCC to show real-time boutique stock availability for a product. SFCC sends a product ID and country code; MuleSoft queries NewStore for stores in that country, checks per-store stock levels, and returns a consolidated availability list.\n\n---\n\nArchitecture — Three-Layer API\n------------------------------\n\nDefaultnoneSFCC (PDP / Store Details)\n│\n└──[POST /find-in-store]──► Experience API (SFCC-facing entry point)\n│ auth + request transform\n└──► Product Availability Process API\n│ get stores (GET) + get stock (POST)\n└──► NewStore System API\n│\n└──► NewStore\n\n| Layer | API | Responsibility |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Experience | `magento-exp-api` | Accept SFCC request, transform, call Process API. Circuit breaker + 3 retries |\n| Process | `product-availibility-prc-api` | Filter stores by country, iterate stock per store, consolidate response. 3 retries each call |\n| System | `newstore-sys-api` | GET /stores (list); POST /stores/products (stock qty). 3 retries |\n\n---\n\nAPI Endpoints\n-------------\n\n### Experience API (SFCC Entry Point)\n\n| Environment | URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Local | `http://localhost:8081/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n| Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-dev/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n| QA | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api-qa/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n| Prod | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/magento-exp-api/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n\n### Product Availability Process API\n\n| Environment | URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/product-availibility-prc-api-dev/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n| QA | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/product-availibility-prc-api-qa/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n| Prod | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/product-availibility-prc-api/api/find-in-store` | POST |\n\n### NewStore System API\n\n| Operation | Environment | URL | Method |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| List All Stores | Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/newstore-sys-api-dev/api/stores` | GET |\n| Get Stock Qty | Dev | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/newstore-sys-api-dev/api/stores/products` | POST |\n| List All Stores | Prod | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/newstore-sys-api/api/stores` | GET |\n| Get Stock Qty | Prod | `https://mw.staging.zimmermann.com/newstore-sys-api/api/stores/products` | POST |\n\n---\n\nSample Request & Response\n-------------------------\n\n### SFCC Request\n\nDefaultjson{ \"ProductId\": \"2350275\", \"CountryCode\": \"GB\" }\n\n### Response\n\nDefaultjson[\n{ \"StoreId\": \"31434\", \"qty\": 1 },\n{ \"StoreId\": \"ZIMMERMANN\\_LONDON\\_STORE\", \"qty\": 0 }\n]\n\n---\n\nSecurity\n--------\n\n| Control | Detail |\n| --- | --- |\n| Authentication | Client credentials (`client_id` + `client_secret`) |\n| Transport | HTTPS only |\n| Secret storage | Mule secure property placeholder |\n\n---\n\nNon-Functional Requirements\n---------------------------\n\n| Requirement | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Monitoring | Anypoint Platform |\n| Retry strategy | 3 retries per API layer |\n| Resilience | Circuit breaker at Experience API layer |",
      "format": "markdown"
    },
    "page_width": "fixed-width"
  }
}"}

